#
# S26 port of testkit's reload-cycle/post-reload.rule. Run by the driver
# AFTER the whole reload series, against cache_turbo's own probe (see
# ../env) since this scenario's conf routes @PROBE@ there rather than at
# testkit's generic test_ref_probe.
#
# The pid oracle is STRICT (no pid_may_change): every reload happened
# outside this prober invocation, so both of this case's probe snapshots
# see the same, already-settled worker.

name    the final reloaded worker serves cache_turbo cleanly
from    127.0.0.1
send    GET /cached/item HTTP/1.1\r\n
send    Host: prober\r\nConnection: close\r\n\r\n
expect  status=200
expect  header~X-Cache: HIT
delta   fds == 0
no_error_log  \[error\]
